    <string name="switchly_overview_info_title">About Switchly overview</string>
    <string name="switchly_overview_info_body">This overview counts activity handled by Switchly, including NFC, QR and barcode scans, active time, opens, blocks, reached limits, effective enable and disable changes, and schedule executions.\n\nThe values are stored locally as permanent statistics and are included when Statistics/counters is selected for JSON or cloud backup. Existing scan and schedule totals remain available. Detailed enable, disable, limit, and schedule-result counters begin with the updates that introduced those counters because older action sources cannot be reconstructed reliably.</string>
    <string name="switchly_overview_storage_note">Stored locally and included in Statistics/counters backups. Detailed state-change counters begin with this update.</string>
